an in aiki"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Cooking (Japanese food only), basking in the sun"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Things to do during days off: Cleaning and Laundry"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Future goals: Become the main character's miko bride"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"People I respect: the head miko"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13512"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f307e55deede696b045a758c461da152c09b95acfbb2cbff1fd9ff6ebc5ad07.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a97a5125e565d6edd03b474f910d5274fe95fdb5ba2a218c0f89eb7555c304f0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春瀬 みき","creatorId":"vndb:s1566","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1566","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1566","name":"春瀬 みき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34969","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13513","characterName":"緑川 琴音","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13513"},"originalCharacterName":"緑川 琴音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is bright, honest, and kind to everyone. She is impeccable and in a sense, an ideal woman. She is so pretty that she has a kind of fan club, but she does not like to be pampered."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She becomes friends with the main character as she teaches him. (The main character is really smart and has excellent grades.)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"People who know rumors about the main character run away and do not want to come near him. Therefore, she is also convenient. She feels comfortable with him because he is not pushy. She is a caring person and mends the the main chracter's torn pants."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite foods: Meat pie, gratin, chocolate and banana crepe, cafe au lait without sugar"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite movies: Romance movies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite music: J-POP"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special skills: Making cakes"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Window shopping"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Things to do during days off: Reading, walking her dog"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Future goals: open a day care center"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"People I respect: my parents"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13513"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69e69f33fa84f7b3cbf31cccc642f6d5ce9cd62bda95774b7e64c0e3643edfbd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8b7339e04f4eec4f2ec5f8065ed039fe722fab3e9466c7bc14d57ea1c099586f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c80465","characterName":"生田 政和","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c80465"},"originalCharacterName":"生田 政和","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main character. He is a childhood friend of the heroine Nayuka, who was born and raised in the village."},{"spoiler":false,"tex